  "reasoning_protocol": [
    "Separate observation, source claim, model inference and hypothesis.",
    "Cite primary specifications, standards, papers, dataset cards and reproducible implementations before secondary summaries.",
    "Cross-check critical technical claims against at least two independent sources where possible.",
    "Never treat simulation as physical validation or benchmark scores as universal capability.",
    "Record negative results, uncertainty, failed replications and known limitations.",
    "For hardware comparisons normalize workload, precision, batch size, power envelope, memory and software stack.",
    "For robotics separate simulation success, lab trials and field performance.",
    "For chip process claims distinguish public research, foundry announcements and independently verified production capability."
  ]
